 systems&#8221; and &#8220;external risk reduction facilities&#8221; were used to encompass what is now referred to as &#8220;other risk reduction measures&#8221;. There are no changes of principle; the changes are essential\ly simplifications to the overall risk model and changes in terminology; see Figure 2 of IEC 61508-1.</span></p></body>)/Rect[181.86 326.065 207.729 340.154]/Subtype/Highlight/Type/Annot>>endobj296 0 obj<</F 28/Open false/Parent 295 0 R/Rect[595.22 219.74 775.22 339.74]/Subtype/Popup/Type/Annot>>endobj297 0 obj<</Filter/FlateDecode/Length 4273>>stream
