m design r\equirements specification; see 7.10 and Figure 3 of IEC 61508-2 ed2.0.</span></p></body>)/Rect[437.226 123.989 463.1 138.075]/Subtype/Highlight/Type/Annot>>endobj334 0 obj<</F 28/Open false/Parent 333 0 R/Rect[595.22 17.6601 775.22 137.66]/Subtype/Popup/Type/Annot>>endobj335 0 obj<</AP<</N 7419 0 R>>/C[1.0 1.0 0.0]/Contents(\(75\) These are new requirements brought about by the inclusion of Application Specific Integrated Circuits \(ASICs\) within the scope of IEC 61508 ed2.0. \rThe definition of ASIC covers a range of devices; see 3.2.15 of IEC 61508-4 ed2.0 and the associa\ted Note to the definition.\rA detailed V-model of the ASIC development lifecycle for the design of ASICs is shown in Figure 3; see 7.1.3.1.\rThe design of the E/E/PE safety-related system now includes explicit requirements for ASICs; see 7.4.2.2.\rInform\ative Annex F provides techniques and measures for the avoidance of systematic failures in ASICs.)/CreationDate(D:20100523181349+02'00')/F 132/M(D:20100524172137+02'00')/NM(ea6994b0-5c37-4462-a8b1-382555055820)/P 331 0 R/Popup 336 0 R/QuadPoints[463.085 137.66 481.881 137.66 463.085 124.403 481.881 124.403]/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:7.1.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2" ><p dir="ltr"><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.0pt;font-weight:bold">\(75\)</span><span \dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.0pt"> These are new requirements brought about by the inclusion of Application Specific Integrated Circuits \(ASICs\) within the scope of IEC 61508 ed2.0. &#13;The definition of ASIC covers a range of devices; see 3.2.15 of I\EC 61508-4 ed2.0 and the associated Note to the definition.&#13;A detailed V-model of the ASIC development lifecycle for the design of ASICs is shown in Figure 3; see 7.1.3.1.&#13;The design of the E/E/PE safety-related system now includes explicit requir\ements for ASICs; see 7.4.2.2.&#13;Informative Annex F provides techniques and measures for the avoidance of systematic failures in ASICs.</span></p></body>)/Rect[459.546 123.989 485.421 138.075]/Subtype/Highlight/Type/Annot>>endobj336 0 obj<</F 28/Open false/Parent 335 0 R/Rect[595.22 17.6601 775.22 137.66]/Subtype/Popup/Type/Annot>>endobj337 0 obj<</Filter/FlateDecode/Length 6405>>stream
