E/E/PE safety-related systemsŽ and other risk reduction measuresŽ. In IEC 61508 ed1.0 the terms other technology safety related systemsŽ and external risk\ reduction facilitiesŽ were used to encompass what is now referred to as other risk reduction measuresŽ. There are no changes of principle; the changes are essentially simplifications to the overall risk model and changes in terminology; see Figure 2 of \IEC 61508-1.)/CreationDate(D:20100523170343+02'00')/F 132/M(D:20100524172217+02'00')/NM(e3cddbca-4b8d-439b-b358-4019b21f9fec)/P 569 0 R/Popup 579 0 R/QuadPoints[137.999 533.536 156.805 533.536 137.999 520.279 156.805 520.279]/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:7.1.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2" ><p dir="ltr"><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.0pt;font-weight:bold">\(13\) </span><span\ dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.0pt">The risk reduction model in IEC 61508 ed2.0 comprises the risk reduction arising from the &#8220;E/E/PE safety-related systems&#8221; and &#8220;other risk reduction measures&#8221;. In IEC 61508 ed1.0 the terms &#8220;\other technology safety related systems&#8221; and &#8220;external risk reduction facilities&#8221; were used to encompass what is now referred to as &#8220;other risk reduction measures&#8221;. There are no changes of principle; the changes are essential\ly simplifications to the overall risk model and changes in terminology; see Figure 2 of IEC 61508-1.</span></p></body>)/Rect[134.46 519.865 160.344 533.95]/Subtype/Highlight/Type/Annot>>endobj579 0 obj<</F 28/Open false/Parent 578 0 R/Rect[595.22 413.536 775.22 533.536]/Subtype/Popup/Type/Annot>>endobj580 0 obj<</AP<</N 7553 0 R>>/C[1.0 1.0 0.0]/Contents(\(51\) One or more requirements of this subclause are now contained in 7.5.2.3.)/CreationDate(D:20100523172818+02'00')/F 132/M(D:20100524172217+02'00')/NM(d0dde06a-bcad-4387-a324-155661b06fed)/P 569 0 R/Popup 581 0 R/Qua