uresŽ. In IEC 61508 ed1.0 the terms other technology safety related systemsŽ and external risk\ reduction facilitiesŽ were used to encompass what is now referred to as other risk reduction measuresŽ. There are no changes of principle; the changes are essentially simplifications to the overall risk model and changes in terminology; see Figure 2 of \IEC 61508-1.)/CreationDate(D:20100523170349+02'00')/F 132/M(D:20100524172217+02'00')/NM(70ee51c4-5959-4ed1-b84a-dfcce23cb0b4)/P 590 0 R/Popup 595 0 R/QuadPoints[210.354 638.54 229.159 638.54 210.354 625.283 229.159 625.283]/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:7.1.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2" ><p dir="ltr"><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.0pt;font-weight:bold">\(13\) </span><span\ dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.0pt">The risk reduction model in IEC 61508 ed2.0 comprises the risk reduction arising from the &#8220;E/E/PE safety-related systems&#8221; and &#8220;other risk reduction measures&#8221;. In IEC 61508 ed1.0 the terms &#8220;\other technology safety related systems&#8221; and &#8220;external risk reduction facilities&#8221; were used to encompass what is now referred to as &#8220;other risk reduction measures&#8221;. There are no changes of principle; the changes are essential\ly simplifications to the overall risk model and changes in terminology; see Figure 2 of IEC 61508-1.</span></p></body>)/Rect[206.814 624.869 232.698 638.954]/Subtype/Highlight/Type/Annot>>endobj595 0 obj<</F 28/Open false/Parent 594 0 R/Rect[595.22 518.54 775.22 638.54]/Subtype/Popup/Type/Annot>>endobj596 0 obj<</AP<</N 7562 0 R>>/C[1.0 1.0 0.0]/Contents(\(13\) The risk reduction model in IEC 61508 ed2.0 comprises the risk reduction arising from the E/E/PE safety-related systemsŽ and other risk reduction measuresŽ. In IEC 61508 ed1.0 the terms other technology safety related systemsŽ and external risk\ reduction facilitiesŽ wer