 </span><span\ dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.0pt">The risk reduction model in IEC 61508 ed2.0 comprises the risk reduction arising from the &#8220;E/E/PE safety-related systems&#8221; and &#8220;other risk reduction measures&#8221;. In IEC 61508 ed1.0 the terms &#8220;\other technology safety related systems&#8221; and &#8220;external risk reduction facilities&#8221; were used to encompass what is now referred to as &#8220;other risk reduction measures&#8221;. There are no changes of principle; the changes are essential\ly simplifications to the overall risk model and changes in terminology; see Figure 2 of IEC 61508-1.</span></p></body>)/Rect[310.741 304.347 336.609 318.432]/Subtype/Highlight/Type/Annot>>endobj616 0 obj<</F 28/Open false/Parent 615 0 R/Rect[595.22 198.018 775.22 318.018]/Subtype/Popup/Type/Annot>>endobj617 0 obj<</AP<</N 7580 0 R>>/C[1.0 1.0 0.0]/Contents(\(13\) The risk reduction model in IEC 61508 ed2.0 comprises the risk reduction arising from the E/E/PE safety-related systemsŽ and other risk reduction measuresŽ. In IEC 61508 ed1.0 the terms other technology safety related systemsŽ and external risk\ reduction facilitiesŽ were used to encompass what is now referred to as other risk reduction measuresŽ. There are no changes of principle; the changes are essentially simplifications to the overall risk model and changes in terminology; see Figure 2 of \IEC 61508-1.)/CreationDate(D:20100523170428+02'00')/F 132/M(D:20100524172228+02'00')/NM(9a597258-ee39-467f-84f1-7b5269662367)/P 612 0 R/Popup 618 0 R/QuadPoints[388.925 268.22 407.721 268.22 388.925 254.963 407.721 254.963]/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:7.1.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2" ><p dir="ltr"><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.0pt;font-weight:bold">\(13\) </span><span\ dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.0pt">The risk reduction model in IEC 61508 ed2.0 comprises the risk reduction arising from the &#8220;E/E/PE safety-related systems&#8221; and &#8220;other risk reduction measures&#8221;. In IEC 61508 ed1.0 the terms &#8220;\other technology safety related systems&#8221; and &#8220;external risk reduction facilities&#8221; were used to encompass what is now referred to as &#8220;other risk reduction measures&#8221;. There are no changes of principle; the changes are essential\ly simplifications to the overall risk model and changes in terminology; see Figure 2 of IEC 61508-1.</span></p></body>)/Rect[385.386 254.549 411.26 268.634]/Subtype/Highlight/Type/Annot>>endobj618 0 obj<</F 28/Open false/Parent 617 0 R/Rect[595.22 148.22 775.22 268.22]/Subtype/Popup/Type/Annot>>endobj619 0 obj<</AP<</N 7583 0 R>>/C[1.0 1.0 0.0]/Contents(\(46\) The word overall" has been added to indicate that the safety functions requirements and the safety integrity requirements are part of the Overall Safety Requirements; see 7.5.2.1 including the Notes of IEC 61508-1 ed2.0.)/CreationDate(D:20100523172534+02'00')/F 132/M(D:20100524172228+02'00')/NM(29ada762-5cbc-436c-afec-a81250adf0ed)/P 612 0 R/Popup 620 0 R/QuadPoints[231.24 341.78 250.03 341.78 231.24 328.523 250.03 328.523]/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:7.1.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2" ><p dir="ltr"><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.0pt;font-weight:bold">\(46\) </span><span\ dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.0pt">The word &#8220;overall&quot; has been added to indicate that the safety functions requirements and the safety integrity requirements are part of the Overall Safety Requirements; see 7.5.2.1 including the Notes of IEC 6\1508-1 ed2.0.</span></p></body>)/Rect[227.7 328.109 253.569 342.194]/Subtype/Highlight/Type/Annot>>endobj620 0 obj<</F 28/Open false/Parent 619 0 R/Rect[595.22 221.78 775.22 341.78]/Subtype/Popup/Type/Annot>>endobj621 0 obj<</AP<</N 7587 0 R>>/C[1.0 1.0 0.0]/Contents(\(5