 simplifications to the overall risk model and changes in terminology; see Figure 2 of IEC 61508-1.</span></p></body>)/Rect[163.621 604.709 189.487 618.794]/Subtype/Highlight/Type/Annot>>endobj687 0 obj<</F 28/Open false/Parent 686 0 R/Rect[595.22 498.38 775.22 618.38]/Subtype/Popup/Type/Annot>>endobj688 0 obj<</AP<</N 7605 0 R>>/C[1.0 1.0 0.0]/Contents(\(1T2\) The revised wording provides a more precise technical description of the intended requirement; see 3.6.18 of IEC 61508-4 ed2.0.)/CreationDate(D:20100523175403+02'00')/F 132/M(D:20100524172239+02'00')/NM(9870732b-9cbc-4692-9e69-d83b0bac87fb)/P 669 0 R/Popup 689 0 R/QuadPoints[387.6 162.009 408.15 162.009 387.6 151.307 408.15 151.307]/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:7.1.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2" ><p dir="ltr"><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.0pt;font-weight:bold">\(1T2\)</span><span\ dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.0pt"> The revised wording provides a more precise technical description of the intended requirement; see 3.6.18 of IEC 61508-4 ed2.0.</span></p></body>)/Rect[384.743 150.973 411.007 162.343]/Subtype/Highlight/Type/Annot>>endobj689 0 obj<</F 28/Open false/Parent 688 0 R/Rect[595.22 42.0085 775.22 162.009]/Subtype/Popup/Type/Annot>>endobj690 0 obj<</AP<</N 7608 0 R>>/C[1.0 1.0 0.0]/Contents(\(1T2\) The revised wording provides a more precise technical description of the intended requirement; see 3.6.18 of IEC 61508-4 ed2.0.)/CreationDate(D:20100523175413+02'00')/F 132/M(D:20100524172239+02'00')/NM(9dacd4a2-6705-40ea-858d-14af1f2e5057)/P 669 0 R/Popup 691 0 R/QuadPoints[342.72 149.409 363.27 149.409 342.72 138.707 363.27 138.707]/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:7.1.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2" ><p dir="ltr"><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.0pt;font-weight:bold">\(1T2\)</span><span\ 