 safety requirements specification is itself comprised of:&#13;the E/E/PE system safety functions requirements specification; see 7.2.6 of IEC 61508-1 ed2.0; and&#13;the E/E/PE system safety integrity require\ments specification; see 7.2.7 of IEC 61508-1 ed2.0.</span></p></body>)/Rect[413.601 370.19 439.469 384.275]/Subtype/Highlight/Type/Annot>>endobj815 0 obj<</F 28/Open false/Parent 814 0 R/Rect[595.22 263.861 775.22 383.861]/Subtype/Popup/Type/Annot>>endobj816 0 obj<</Filter/FlateDecode/Length 3117>>stream
