.7103 78.9156]/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:7.1.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2" ><p dir="ltr"><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.0pt;font-weight:bold">\(13\) </span><span\ dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.0pt">The risk reduction model in IEC 61508 ed2.0 comprises the risk reduction arising from the &#8220;E/E/PE safety-related systems&#8221; and &#8220;other risk reduction measures&#8221;. In IEC 61508 ed1.0 the terms &#8220;\other technology safety related systems&#8221; and &#8220;external risk reduction facilities&#8221; were used to encompass what is now referred to as &#8220;other risk reduction measures&#8221;. There are no changes of principle; the changes are essential\ly simplifications to the overall risk model and changes in terminology; see Figure 2 of IEC 61508-1.</span></p></body>)/Rect[67.381 78.5012 93.2494 92.5868]/Subtype/Highlight/Type/Annot>>endobj845 0 obj<</F 28/Open false/Parent 844 0 R/Rect[595.22 -27.8277 775.22 92.1723]/Subtype/Popup/Type/Annot>>endobj846 0 obj<</AP<</N 7686 0 R>>/C[1.0 1.0 0.0]/Contents(\(59B\) The risk reduction model in IEC 61508 ed2.0 comprises the risk reduction arising from the E/E/PE safety-related systemsŽ and other risk reduction measuresŽ. In IEC 61508 ed1.0 the terms other technology safety related systemsŽ and external ris\k reduction facilitiesŽ were used to encompass what is now referred to as other risk reduction measuresŽ. There are no changes of principle; the changes are essentially simplifications to the overall risk model and changes in terminology; see Figure 2 of\ IEC 61508-1. One or more requirements of this subclause are now contained in 7.11. \rTherefore, the requirements for other technology safety related systemsŽ and external risk reduction facilitiesŽ are now covered in 7.12 other risk reduction measures\: specification and realisationŽ.)/CreationDate(D:20100523173655+02'00')/F 132/M(D:20100524172257+02'00')/NM(36d82046-ac84-4585-b89f-98b3bc438ae6)/P 840 0 R/Popup 847 0 R/QuadPoints[257.52 616.62 283.273 616.58 257.52 602.815 283.273 603.323]/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:7.1.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2" ><p dir="ltr"><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.0pt;font-weight:bold">\(59B\)</span><span\ dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.0pt"> The risk reduction model in IEC 61508 ed2.0 comprises the risk reduction arising from the &#8220;E/E/PE safety-related systems&#8221; and &#8220;other risk reduction measures&#8221;. In IEC 61508 ed1.0 the terms &#8220\;other technology safety related systems&#8221; and &#8220;external risk reduction facilities&#8221; were used to encompass what is now referred to as &#8220;other risk reduction measures&#8221;. There are no changes of principle; the changes are essentia\lly simplifications to the overall risk model and changes in terminology; see Figure 2 of IEC 61508-1. One or more requirements of this subclause are now contained in 7.11. &#13;Therefore, the requirements for &#8220;other technology safety related system\s&#8221; and &#8220;external risk reduction facilities&#8221; are now covered in 7.12 &#8220;other risk reduction measures: specification and realisation&#8221;.</span></p></body>)/Rect[253.852 602.401 286.812 617.034]/Subtype/Highlight/Type/Annot>>endobj847 0 obj<</F 28/Open false/Parent 846 0 R/Rect[595.22 496.62 775.22 616.62]/Subtype/Popup/Type/Annot>>endobj848 0 obj<</AP<</N 7680 0 R>>/C[1.0 1.0 0.0]/Contents(\(59B\) The risk reduction model in IEC 61508 ed2.0 comprises the risk reduction arising from the E/E/PE safety-related systemsŽ and other risk reduction measuresŽ. In IEC 61508 ed1.0 the terms other technology safety related systemsŽ and external ris\k reduction facilitiesŽ were used to encompass what is now referred to as other risk reduction measuresŽ. There are no changes of principle; the changes are essentially simplifications to the overall risk model and changes in terminology; see Figure 2 of\ IEC 61508-1. One or more requirements of this subclause are now contained in 7.11. \rTherefore, the requirements for other technology safety related systemsŽ and external risk reduction facilitiesŽ are now covered in 7.12 other risk reduction measures\: specification and realisationŽ.)/CreationDate(D:20100523173708+02'00')/F 132/M(D:20100524172257+02'00')/NM(c7eb9cb1-0c44-4011-a4fa-bd64208f3b33)/P 840 0 R/Popup 849 0 R/QuadPoints[332.52 391.86 358.273 391.82 332.52 378.055 358.273 378.563]/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:7.1.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2" ><p dir="ltr"><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.0pt;font-weight:bold">\(59B\)</span><span\ dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.0pt"> The risk reduction model in IEC 61508 ed2.0 comprises the risk reduction arising from the &#8220;E/E/PE safety-related systems&#8221; and &#8220;other risk reduction measures&#8221;. In IEC 61508 ed1.0 the terms &#8220\;other technology safety related systems&#8221; and &#8220;external risk reduction facilities&#8221; were used to encompass what is now referred to as &#8220;other risk reduction measures&#8221;. There are no changes of principle; the changes are essentia\lly simplifications to the overall risk model and changes in terminology; see Figure 2 of IEC 61508-1. One or more requirements of this subclause are now contained in 7.11. &#13;Therefore, the requirements for &#8220;other technology safety related system\s&#8221; and &#8220;external risk reduction facilities&#8221; are now covered in 7.12 &#8220;other risk reduction measures: specification and realisation&#8221;.</span></p></body>)/Rect[328.852 377.641 361.812 392.274]/Subtype/Highlight/Type/Annot>>endobj849 0 obj<</F 28/Open false/Parent 848 0 R/Rect[595.22 271.86 775.22 391.86]/Subtype/Popup/Type/Annot>>endobj850 0 obj<</Filter/FlateDecode/Length 3879>>stream
