1; and &#8220;external risk reduction facilities&#8221; were used to encompass what is now referred to as &#8220;other risk reduction measures&#8221;. There are no changes of principle; the changes are essential\ly simplifications to the overall risk model and changes in terminology; see Figure 2 of IEC 61508-1.</span></p></body>)/Rect[228.544 705.744 254.415 719.829]/Subtype/Highlight/Type/Annot>>endobj857 0 obj<</F 28/Open false/Parent 856 0 R/Rect[595.22 599.415 775.22 719.415]/Subtype/Popup/Type/Annot>>endobj858 0 obj<</Filter/FlateDecode/Length 2957>>stream
