ICs is shown in Figure 3; see 7.1.3.1.&#13;The design of the E/E/PE safety-related system now includes explicit requir\ements for ASICs; see 7.4.2.2.&#13;Informative Annex F provides techniques and measures for the avoidance of systematic failures in ASICs.</span></p></body>)/Rect[419.457 425.18 445.573 439.266]/Subtype/Highlight/Type/Annot>>endobj1764 0 obj<</F 28/Open false/Parent 1763 0 R/Rect[595.22 318.851 775.22 438.851]/Subtype/Popup/Type/Annot>>endobj1765 0 obj<</Filter/FlateDecode/Length 7597>>stream
