ed2.0 now has two specifications: &#13;the E/E/PE system safety requirements specification; see 7.10 and Figure 2 of IEC 61508-1 ed2.0; and&#13;the E/E/PE system design r\equirements specification; see 7.10 and Figure 3 of IEC 61508-2 ed2.0.</span></p></body>)/Rect[137.938 43.9273 163.935 58.0129]/Subtype/Highlight/Type/Annot>>endobj1835 0 obj<</F 28/Open false/Parent 1834 0 R/Rect[595.22 -62.4016 775.22 57.5984]/Subtype/Popup/Type/Annot>>endobj1836 0 obj<</Filter/FlateDecode/Length 9293>>stream
