pecified safety function.</span></p></body>)/Rect[439.023 694.581 466.215 708.667]/Subtype/Highlight/Type/Annot>>endobj2106 0 obj<</F 28/Open false/Parent 2105 0 R/Rect[595.22 588.252 775.22 708.252]/Subtype/Popup/Type/Annot>>endobj2107 0 obj<</AP<</N 8305 0 R>>/C[1.0 1.0 0.0]/Contents(\(1\) The term "element" although used extensively in IEC 61508 ed1.0 was not a defined term. The term has now been defined in 3.4.5 of IEC 61508-4 ed2.0.)/CreationDate(D:20100523155903+02'00')/F 132/M(D:20100524172512+02'00')/NM(e83bd00d-b273-406e-b85f-77303c15e4f7)/P 2092 0 R/Popup 2108 0 R/QuadPoints[353.041 708.252 365.959 708.252 353.041 694.996 365.959 694.996]/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:7.1.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2" ><p dir="ltr"><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.0pt;font-weight:bold">\(1\)</span><span d\ir="ltr" style="font-size:10.0pt"> The term &quot;element&quot; although used extensively in IEC 61508 ed1.0 was not a defined term. The term has now been defined in 3.4.5 of IEC 61508-4 ed2.0.</span></p></body>)/Rect[349.502 694.581 369.498 708.667]/Subtype/Highlight/Type/Annot>>endobj2108 0 obj<</F 28/Open false/Parent 2107 0 R/Rect[595.22 588.252 775.22 708.252]/Subtype/Popup/Type/Annot>>endobj2109 0 obj<</AP<</N 8312 0 R>>/C[1.0 1.0 0.0]/Contents(\(95\) The description of type A in IEC 61508 ed2.0 is focussed on an element. In IEC 61508 ed1.0 it was focussed on a subsystem.)/CreationDate(D:20100523183049+02'00')/F 132/M(D:20100524172512+02'00')/NM(c5687ac2-1d35-4cc9-b7ce-eafc9a50e715)/P 2092 0 R/Popup 2110 0 R/QuadPoints[212.884 708.252 231.794 708.252 212.884 694.996 231.794 694.996]/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:7.1.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2" ><p dir="ltr"><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.0pt;font-weight:bold">\(95\)</span><span \dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.0pt"> The description of type A in IEC 61508 ed2.0 is focussed on an element. In IEC 61508 ed1.0 it was focussed on a subsystem.</span></p></body>)/Rect[209.345 694.581 235.333 708.667]/Subtype/Highlight/Type/Annot>>endobj2110 0 obj<</F 28/Open false/Parent 2109 0 R/Rect[595.22 588.252 775.22 708.252]/Subtype/Popup/Type/Annot>>endobj2111 0 obj<</AP<</N 8309 0 R>>/C[1.0 1.0 0.0]/Contents(\(2T2\) The changes made in this Table, including the Notes, have been made in response to the changes made to the requirements of 7.4.4.2 of IEC 61508-2 ed2.0 \(Route 1H \).)/CreationDate(D:20100523184725+02'00')/F 132/M(D:20100524172512+02'00')/NM(dd4f83fb-0b4a-41e4-975d-d1e288f7bba8)/P 2092 0 R/Popup 2112 0 R/QuadPoints[130.206 719.776 155.721 719.776 130.206 706.519 155.721 706.519]/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:7.1.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2" ><p dir="ltr"><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.0pt;font-weight:bold">\(2T2\)</span><span\ dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.0pt"> The changes made in this Table, including the Notes, have been made in response to the changes made to the requirements of 7.4.4.2 of IEC 61508-2 ed2.0 \(Route 1</span><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.0pt;vertical-a\lign:-5.0pt">H </span><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.0pt">\).</span></p></body>)/Rect[126.667 706.105 159.26 720.19]/Subtype/Highlight/Type/Annot>>endobj2112 0 obj<</F 28/Open false/Parent 2111 0 R/Rect[595.22 599.776 775.22 719.776]/Subtype/Popup/Type/Annot>>endobj2113 0 obj<</Filter/FlateDecode/Length 3983>>stream
