ICs; see 7.4.2.2.&#13;Informative Annex F provides techniques and measures for the avoidance of systematic failures in ASICs.</span></p></body>)/Rect[308.936 741.481 339.932 758.452]/Subtype/Highlight/Type/Annot>>endobj3081 0 obj<</F 28/Open false/Parent 3080 0 R/Rect[595.22 637.952 775.22 757.952]/Subtype/Popup/Type/Annot>>endobj3082 0 obj<</Filter/FlateDecode/Length 5231>>stream
