he ASIC development lifecycle for the design of ASICs is shown in Figure 3; see 7.1.3.1.&#13;The design of the E/E/PE safety-related system now includes explicit requir\ements for ASICs; see 7.4.2.2.&#13;Informative Annex F provides techniques and measures for the avoidance of systematic failures in ASICs.</span></p></body>)/Rect[133.376 397.705 159.373 411.791]/Subtype/Highlight/Type/Annot>>endobj3098 0 obj<</F 28/Open false/Parent 3097 0 R/Rect[595.22 291.376 775.22 411.376]/Subtype/Popup/Type/Annot>>endobj3099 0 obj<</Filter/FlateDecode/Length 5347>>stream
