 the system design and safety integrity level has not necessarily been determined. Software of systematic capability N \(as created by following the requirements of the Standard\) is capable of being used in a f\inal application system to support a safety function of SIL N \(or less\), or in some circumstances to support a safety function of SIL N+1 when used in conjunction with other elements.</span></p></body>)/Rect[306.779 267.149 338.756 281.235]/Subtype/Highlight/Type/Annot>>endobj3541 0 obj<</F 28/Open false/Parent 3540 0 R/Rect[595.22 160.82 775.22 280.82]/Subtype/Popup/Type/Annot>>endobj3542 0 obj<</AP<</N 9209 0 R>>/C[1.0 1.0 0.0]/Contents(\(306\) This Note has been added in recognition of the fact that software not originally developed to meet specific safety requirements, or any safety requirements, may be included in the design under suitable conditions.)/CreationDate(D:20100524140307+02'00')/F 132/M(D:20100524172751+02'00')/NM(fe387386-9fd6-4ba9-9ad7-aaea2a6024b7)/P 3527 0 R/Popup 3543 0 R/QuadPoints[458.52 572.894 478.71 572.894 458.52 562.192 478.71 562.192]/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:7.1.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2" ><p dir="ltr"><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.0pt;font-weight:bold">\(306\)</span><span\ dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.0pt"> This Note has been added in recognition of the fact that software not originally developed to meet specific safety requirements, or any safety requirements, may be included in the design under suitable conditions.</spa\n></p></body>)/Rect[455.664 561.858 481.567 573.228]/Subtype/Highlight/Type/Annot>>endobj3543 0 obj<</F 28/Open false/Parent 3542 0 R/Rect[595.22 452.894 775.22 572.894]/Subtype/Popup/Type/Annot>>endobj3544 0 obj<</AP<</N 9199 0 R>>/C[1.0 1.0 0.0]/Contents(\(307\) The new text regarding independence has been introduced because ed2.0 allows SIL N functions to be achieved by a combination of system elements of SIL N-1 \(systematic capability N-1\).)/CreationDate(D:20100524140333+02'00')/F 132/M(D:20100524172751+02'00')/NM(7befce69-e608-470e-be51-fdc74c823de7)/P 3527 0 R/Popup 3545 0 R/QuadPoints[331.214 530.653 356.215 530.653 331.214 517.396 356.215 517.396]/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:7.1.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2" ><p dir="ltr"><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.0pt;font-weight:bold">\(307\)</span><span\ dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.0pt"> The new text regarding independence has been introduced because ed2.0 allows SIL N functions to be achieved by a combination of system elements of SIL N-1 \(systematic capability N-1\).</span></p></body>)/Rect[327.675 516.981 359.754 531.067]/Subtype/Highlight/Type/Annot>>endobj3545 0 obj<</F 28/Open false/Parent 3544 0 R/Rect[595.22 410.653 775.22 530.653]/Subtype/Popup/Type/Annot>>endobj3546 0 obj<</AP<</N 9192 0 R>>/C[1.0 1.0 0.0]/Contents(\(307\) The new text regarding independence has been introduced because ed2.0 allows SIL N functions to be achieved by a combination of system elements of SIL N-1 \(systematic capability N-1\).)/CreationDate(D:20100524140347+02'00')/F 132/M(D:20100524172751+02'00')/NM(ba570a68-6d52-4c37-b5ec-51697dc9463a)/P 3527 0 R/Popup 3547 0 R/QuadPoints[141.357 431.894 166.269 431.894 141.357 418.637 166.269 418.637]/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:7.1.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2" ><p dir="ltr"><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.0pt;font-weight:bold">\(307\)</span><span\ dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.0pt"> The new text regarding independence has been introduced because ed2.0 allows SIL N functions to be achieved by a combination of system elements of SIL N-1 \(systematic capability N-1\).</span></p></body>)/Rect[137.818 418.222 169.808 432.308]/Subtype/Highlight/Type/Annot>>endobj3547 0 obj<</F 28/Open false/Parent 3546 0 R/Rect[595.22 311.894 775.22 431.894]/Subtype/Popup/Type/Annot>>endobj3548 0 obj<</AP<</N 9193 0 R>>/C[1.0 1.0 0.0]/Contents(\(308\) The new text has been added to correct an important omission from ed1.0.)/CreationDate(D:20100524140424+02'00')/F 132/M(D:20100524172751+02'00')/NM(558634f3-bda8-43c7-a713-b2e00a2e02b1)/P 3527 0 R/Popup 3549 0 R/QuadPoints[460.192 247.817 485.12 247.817 460.192 234.56 485.12 234.56]/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:7.1.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2" ><p dir="ltr"><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.0pt;font-weight:bold">\(308\)</span><span\ dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.0pt"> The new text has been added to correct an important omission from ed1.0.</span></p></body>)/Rect[456.653 234.145 488.659 248.231]/Subtype/Highlight/Type/Annot>>endobj3549 0 obj<</F 28/Open false/Parent 3548 0 R/Rect[595.22 127.817 775.22 247.817]/Subtype/Popup/Type/Annot>>endobj3550 0 obj<</AP<</N 9214 0 R>>/C[1.0 1.0 0.0]/Contents(\(309\) The requirement concerning resolution of disagreements about the software safety integrity level has been removed since it is not properly within the scope of the Standard.)/CreationDate(D:20100524140619+02'00')/F 132/M(D:20100524172751+02'00')/NM(2d6d239a-63d6-400a-91e1-c30a36dc4481)/P 3527 0 R/Popup 3551 0 R/QuadPoints[346.2 214.7 371.12 214.7 346.2 201.443 371.12 201.443]/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:7.1.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2" ><p dir="ltr"><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.0pt;font-weight:bold">\(309\)</span><span\ dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.0pt"> The requirement concerning resolution of disagreements about the software safety integrity level has been removed since it is not properly within the scope of the Standard.</span></p></body>)/R