xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:7.1.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2" ><p dir="ltr"><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.0pt;font-weight:bold">\(335\) </span><spa\n dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.0pt">The implications of using tools in classes T2 and T3 must be analysed and appropriate measures taken to mitigate tool failures \(the important failures are those which lead to the tools producing incorrect or misleadin\g results, rather than simple &#8220;crashes&#8221;\). Mitigations can include measures taken during development, such as inspection of the tool outputs, run-time defences, or both.</span></p></body>)/Rect[195.058 447.345 227.176 461.43]/Subtype/Highlight/Type/Annot>>endobj3846 0 obj<</F 28/Open false/Parent 3845 0 R/Rect[595.22 341.016 775.22 461.016]/Subtype/Popup/Type/Annot>>endobj3847 0 obj<</AP<</N 9392 0 R>>/C[1.0 1.0 0.0]/Contents(\(336\) For those tools which are more critical to the development of correct safety related software, ed2.0 requires suitable evidence that they have been validated as fit for purpose in the software lifecycle. This valuation must be repeated if a new ve\rsion of the tool in introduced during software development or maintenance.)/CreationDate(D:20100524142758+02'00')/F 132/M(D:20100524172829+02'00')/NM(eb3551d4-1d7f-45ad-8783-3435d6e36e55)/P 3841 0 R/Popup 3848 0 R/QuadPoints[399.241 723.13 424.149 723.13 399.241 709.873 424.149 709.873]/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:7.1.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2" ><p dir="ltr"><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.0pt;font-weight:bold">\(336\) </span><spa\n dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.0pt">For those tools which are more critical to the development of correct safety related software, ed2.0 requires suitable evidence that they have been validated as fit for purpose in the software lifecycle. This valuation\ must be repeated if a new version of the tool in introduced during software development or maintenance.</span></p></body>)/Rect[395.702 709.458 427.688 723.544]/Subtype/Highlight/Type/Annot>>endobj3848 0 obj<</F 28/Open false/Parent 3847 0 R/Rect[595.22 603.13 775.22 723.13]/Subtype/Popup/Type/Annot>>endobj3849 0 obj<</AP<</N 9390 0 R>>/C[1.0 1.0 0.0]/Contents(\(336\) For those tools which are more critical to the development of correct safety related software, ed2.0 requires suitable evidence that they have been validated as fit for purpose in the software lifecycle. This valuation must be repeated if a new ve\rsion of the tool in introduced during software development or maintenance.)/CreationDate(D:20100524142803+02'00')/F 132/M(D:20100524172829+02'00')/NM(df9f8a24-00be-47e5-89e6-ccfb2f6b9edf)/P 3841 0 R/Popup 3850 0 R/QuadPoints[106.198 637.457 131.106 637.457 106.198 624.201 131.106 624.201]/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:7.1.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2" ><p dir="ltr"><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.0pt;font-weight:bold">\(336\) </span><spa\n dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.0pt">For those tools which are more critical to the development of correct safety related software, ed2.0 requires suitable evidence that they have been validated as fit for purpose in the software lifecycle. This valuation\ must be repeated if a new version of the tool in introduced during software development or maintenance.</span></p></body>)/Rect[102.659 623.786 134.645 637.872]/Subtype/Highlight/Type/Annot>>endobj3850 0 obj<</F 28/Open false/Parent 3849 0 R/Rect[595.22 517.457 775.22 637.457]/Subtype/Popup/Type/Annot>>endobj3851 0 obj<</AP<</N 9395 0 R>>/C[1.0 1.0 0.0]/Contents(\(337\) If a set of tools is claimed to be integrated \(that is, the output of one tool can form the input of another tool\) then this requirement has been introduced to ensure that the tools are indeed compatible and that information is not lost or corru\pted in the transfer between one tool and another.)/CreationDate(D:20100524142840+02'00')/F 132/M(D:20100524172829+02'00')/NM(e07204fd-52b1-4a00-bde8-62b57f77e440)/P 3841 0 R/Popup 3852 0 R/QuadPoints[450.117 397.1 475.029 397.1 450.117 383.843 475.029 383.843]/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:7.1.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2" ><p dir="ltr"><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.0pt;font-weight:bold">\(337\) </span><spa\n dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.0pt">If a set of tools is claimed to be integrated \(that is, the output of one tool can form the input of another tool\) then this requirement has been introduced to ensure that the tools are indeed compatible and that inf\ormation is not lost or corrupted in the transfer between one tool and another.</span></p></body>)/Rect[446.578 383.429 478.568 397.514]/Subtype/Highlight/Type/Annot>>endobj3852 0 obj<</F 28/Open false/Parent 3851 0 R/Rect[595.22 277.1 775.22 397.1]/Subtype/Popup/Type/Annot>>endobj3853 0 obj<</AP<</N 9405 0 R>>/C[1.0 1.0 0.0]/Contents(\(338\) This requirement has been generalised to include design notations and methods in addition to programming languages.)/CreationDate(D:20100524142908+02'00')/F 132/M(D:20100524172829+02'00')/NM(88998ae3-0653-4f52-868b-f7728db78e40)/P 3841 0 R/Popup 3854 0 R/QuadPoints[389.76 316.337 414.671 316.337 389.76 303.08 414.671 303.08]/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:7.1.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2" ><p dir="ltr"><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.0pt;font-weight:bold">\(338\) </span><spa\n dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.0pt">This requirement has been generalised to include design notations and methods in addition to programming languages.</span></p></body>)/Rect[386.22 302.666 418.21 316.751]/Subtype/Highlight/Type/Annot>>endobj3854 0 obj<