32 775.22 84.8568]/Subtype/Popup/Type/Annot>>endobj3866 0 obj<</AP<</N 9409 0 R>>/C[1.0 1.0 0.0]/Contents(\(336\) For those tools which are more critical to the development of correct safety related software, ed2.0 requires suitable evidence that they have been validated as fit for purpose in the software lifecycle. This valuation must be repeated if a new ve\rsion of the tool in introduced during software development or maintenance.)/CreationDate(D:20100524142814+02'00')/F 132/M(D:20100524172829+02'00')/NM(20a90ea1-137b-4cde-946b-85762939d19e)/P 3860 0 R/Popup 3867 0 R/QuadPoints[480.356 205.817 505.263 205.817 480.356 192.561 505.263 192.561]/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:7.1.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2" ><p dir="ltr"><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.0pt;font-weight:bold">\(336\) </span><spa\n dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.0pt">For those tools which are more critical to the development of correct safety related software, ed2.0 requires suitable evidence that they have been validated as fit for purpose in the software lifecycle. This valuation\ must be repeated if a new version of the tool in introduced during software development or maintenance.</span></p></body>)/Rect[476.817 192.146 508.802 206.232]/Subtype/Highlight/Type/Annot>>endobj3867 0 obj<</F 28/Open false/Parent 3866 0 R/Rect[595.22 85.8173 775.22 205.817]/Subtype/Popup/Type/Annot>>endobj3868 0 obj<</AP<</N 9422 0 R>>/C[1.0 1.0 0.0]/Contents(\(340\) Tools are now available which can generate a complete or almost complete software application from a high level design representation. Although there are extensive general requirements for support tools, this clause has been added to emphasise the\ importance of this class of tool.)/CreationDate(D:20100524143012+02'00')/F 132/M(D:20100524172829+02'00')/NM(4dd5c314-8c77-4e4d-bccb-57eba75a1987)/P 3860 0 R/Popup 3869 0 R/QuadPoints[490.923 489.34 515.835 489.34 490.923 476.083 515.835 476.083]/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:7.1.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2" ><p dir="ltr"><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.0pt;font-weight:bold">\(340\) </span><spa\n dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.0pt">Tools are now available which can generate a complete or almost complete software application from a high level design representation. Although there are extensive general requirements for support tools, this clause ha\s been added to emphasise the importance of this class of tool.</span></p></body>)/Rect[487.384 475.669 519.374 489.754]/Subtype/Highlight/Type/Annot>>endobj3869 0 obj<</F 28/Open false/Parent 3868 0 R/Rect[595.22 369.34 775.22 489.34]/Subtype/Popup/Type/Annot>>endobj3870 0 obj<</AP<</N 9418 0 R>>/C[1.0 1.0 0.0]/Contents(\(341\) Support tools must be included in software configuration management, and ed2.0 makes this much clearer by introducing these specific requirements.)/CreationDate(D:20100524143042+02'00')/F 132/M(D:20100524172829+02'00')/NM(4f8f9ab8-f6b0-4ec9-b38e-0732e44bcd9f)/P 3860 0 R/Popup 3871 0 R/QuadPoints[385.915 439.888 410.835 439.888 385.915 426.632 410.835 426.632]/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:7.1.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2" ><p dir="ltr"><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.0pt;font-weight:bold">\(341\) </span><spa\n dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.0pt">Support tools must be included in software configuration management, and ed2.0 makes this much clearer by introducing these specific requirements.</span></p></body>)/Rect[382.376 426.217 414.374 440.303]/Subtype/Highlight/Type/Annot>>endobj3871 0 obj<</F 28/Open false/Parent 3870 0 R/Rect[595.22 319.888 775.22 439.888]/Subtype/Popup/Type/Annot>>endobj3872 0 obj<</AP<</N 9423 0 R>>/C[1.0 1.0 0.0]/Contents(\(341\) Support tools 