del and changes in terminology; see Figure 2 of IEC 61508-1.</span></p></body>)/Rect[478.746 617.429 504.825 631.514]/Subtype/Highlight/Type/Annot>>endobj5252 0 obj<</F 28/Open false/Parent 5251 0 R/Rect[595.22 511.1 775.22 631.1]/Subtype/Popup/Type/Annot>>endobj5253 0 obj<</Filter/FlateDecode/Length 6239>>stream
