duction facilities&#8221; were used to encompass what is now referred to as &#8220;other risk reduction measures&#8221;. There are no changes of principle; the changes are essential\ly simplifications to the overall risk model and changes in terminology; see Figure 2 of IEC 61508-1.</span></p></body>)/Rect[491.339 149.786 517.455 163.871]/Subtype/Highlight/Type/Annot>>endobj5264 0 obj<</F 28/Open false/Parent 5263 0 R/Rect[595.22 43.4569 775.22 163.457]/Subtype/Popup/Type/Annot>>endobj5265 0 obj<</Filter/FlateDecode/Length 5943>>stream
