her technology safety related systems&#8221; and &#8220;external risk reduction facilities&#8221; were used to encompass what is now referred to as &#8220;other risk reduction measures&#8221;. There are no changes of principle; the changes are essential\ly simplifications to the overall risk model and changes in terminology; see Figure 2 of IEC 61508-1.</span></p></body>)/Rect[403.5 363.146 429.488 377.231]/Subtype/Highlight/Type/Annot>>endobj5305 0 obj<</F 28/Open false/Parent 5304 0 R/Rect[595.22 256.817 775.22 376.817]/Subtype/Popup/Type/Annot>>endobj5306 0 obj<</Filter/FlateDecode/Length 6187>>stream
