of IEC 61508-1.</span></p></body>)/Rect[501.425 475.469 527.541 489.554]/Subtype/Highlight/Type/Annot>>endobj5541 0 obj<</F 28/Open false/Parent 5540 0 R/Rect[595.22 369.14 775.22 489.14]/Subtype/Popup/Type/Annot>>endobj5542 0 obj<</AP<</N 10233 0 R>>/C[1.0 1.0 0.0]/Contents(\(86\) Systematic capabilityŽ is a new concept; see 3.5.9 of IEC 61508-4 ed2.0.)/CreationDate(D:20100523182227+02'00')/F 132/M(D:20100524173115+02'00')/NM(e990a1c7-6e0c-46fd-9583-0e12b2b8849f)/P 5538 0 R/Popup 5543 0 R/QuadPoints[129.001 390.03 149.716 390.03 129.001 375.336 149.716 375.336]/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:7.1.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2" ><p dir="ltr"><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.0pt;font-weight:bold">\(86\)</span><span \dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.0pt"> &#8220;Systematic capability&#8221; is a new concept; see 3.5.9 of IEC 61508-4 ed2.0.</span></p></body>)/Rect[125.078 374.876 153.639 390.489]/Subtype/Highlight/Type/Annot>>endobj5543 0 obj<</F 28/Open false/Parent 5542 0 R/Rect[595.22 270.03 775.22 390.03]/Subtype/Popup/Type/Annot>>endobj5544 0 obj<</Filter/FlateDecode/Length 7584>>stream
