8220;other risk reduction measures&#8221;. There are no changes of principle; the changes are essential\ly simplifications to the overall risk model and changes in terminology; see Figure 2 of IEC 61508-1.</span></p></body>)/Rect[316.375 522.989 342.488 537.074]/Subtype/Highlight/Type/Annot>>endobj5711 0 obj<</F 28/Open false/Parent 5710 0 R/Rect[595.22 416.66 775.22 536.66]/Subtype/Popup/Type/Annot>>endobj5712 0 obj<</AP<</N 10270 0 R>>/C[1.0 1.0 0.0]/Contents(\(13\) The risk reduction model in IEC 61508 ed2.0 comprises the risk reduction arising from the E/E/PE safety-related systemsŽ and other risk reduction measuresŽ. In IEC 61508 ed1.0 the terms other technology safety related systemsŽ and external risk\ reduction facilitiesŽ were used to encompass what is now referred to as other risk reduction measuresŽ. There are no changes of principle; the changes are essentially simplifications to the overall risk model and changes in terminology; see Figure 2 of \IEC 61508-1.)/CreationDate(D:20100523170604+02'00')/F 132/M(D:20100524173122+02'00')/NM(06a3239b-baa4-454a-857c-26eff8100c14)/P 5707 0 R/Popup 5713 0 R/QuadPoints[421.417 357.98 440.44 357.98 421.417 344.723 440.44 344.723]/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:7.1.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2" ><p dir="ltr"><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.0pt;font-weight:bold">\(13\) </span><span\ dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.0pt">The risk reduction model in IEC 61508 ed2.0 comprises the risk reduction arising from the &#8220;E/E/PE safety-related systems&#8221; and &#8220;other risk reduction measures&#8221;. In IEC 61508 ed1.0 the terms &#8220;\other technology safety related systems&#8221; and &#8220;external risk reduction facilities&#8221; were used to encompass what is now referred to as &#8220;other risk reduction measures&#8221;. There are no changes of principle; the changes are essential\ly simplifications to the overall risk model and changes in terminology; see Figure 2 of IEC 61508-1.</span></p></body>)/Rect[417.878 344.309 443.979 358.394]/Subtype/Highlight/Type/Annot>>endobj5713 0 obj<</F 28/Open false/Parent 5712 0 R/Rect[595.22 237.98 775.22 357.98]/Subtype/Popup/Type/Annot>>endobj5714 0 obj<</Filter/FlateDecode/Length 5506>>stream
