d be clearer to just use the da\ngerous failure rate for each element. Therefore, the split between dangerous failure and safe failure is no longer relevant. &#13;Also the formula for the 1oo2D was updated to include a percentage of undetected failure in the comparison between the two c\hannel architecture.</span></p></body>)/Rect[192.292 324.74 224.305 338.861]/Subtype/Highlight/Type/Annot>>endobj6084 0 obj<</F 28/Open false/Parent 6083 0 R/Rect[595.22 218.445 775.22 338.445]/Subtype/Popup/Type/Annot>>endobj6085 0 obj<</Filter/FlateDecode/Length 5454>>stream
