ered that it would be clearer to just use the da\ngerous failure rate for each element. Therefore, the split between dangerous failure and safe failure is no longer relevant. &#13;Also the formula for the 1oo2D was updated to include a percentage of undetected failure in the comparison between the two c\hannel architecture.</span></p></body>)/Rect[127.851 555.378 159.871 569.507]/Subtype/Highlight/Type/Annot>>endobj6112 0 obj<</F 28/Open false/Parent 6111 0 R/Rect[595.22 449.091 775.22 569.091]/Subtype/Popup/Type/Annot>>endobj6113 0 obj<</Filter/FlateDecode/Length 12261>>stream
