r to just use the da\ngerous failure rate for each element. Therefore, the split between dangerous failure and safe failure is no longer relevant. &#13;Also the formula for the 1oo2D was updated to include a percentage of undetected failure in the comparison between the two c\hannel architecture.</span></p></body>)/Rect[190.124 457.21 222.252 471.368]/Subtype/Highlight/Type/Annot>>endobj6387 0 obj<</F 28/Open false/Parent 6386 0 R/Rect[595.22 350.951 775.22 470.951]/Subtype/Popup/Type/Annot>>endobj6388 0 obj<</Filter/FlateDecode/Length 5611>>stream
