Parent 6598 0 R/Rect[595.22 395.427 775.22 515.427]/Subtype/Popup/Type/Annot>>endobj6600 0 obj<</AP<</N 10599 0 R>>/C[1.0 1.0 0.0]/Contents(\(40\) The Overall Safety Lifecycle has been modified to take into account that:\ra\) In IEC 61508 ed1.0 there was only one specification covering the safety requirements for an E/E/PE safety-related system \(i.e. the E/E/PES safety requirements specifica\tion\). IEC 61508 ed2.0 now has two specifications: \rthe E/E/PE system safety requirements specification; see 7.10 and Figure 2 of IEC 61508-1 ed2.0; and\rthe E/E/PE system design requirements specification; see 7.10 and Figure 3 of IEC 61508-2 ed2.0.\rb\\) The change to the overall risk reduction model used in IEC 61508 ed2.0 has led to the merging of Boxes 10 and 11 in Figure 2 of IEC 61508-1 ed1.0 into a single Box 11 in Figure 2 of IEC 61508-1 ed2.0; see also Explanation 13.)/CreationDate(D:20100523172013+02'00')/F 132/M(D:20100524173310+02'00')/NM(75662c6c-0423-4669-8c04-0f56973d0bdd)/P 6596 0 R/Popup 6601 0 R/QuadPoints[352.316 515.427 373.034 515.427 352.316 500.732 373.034 500.732]/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:7.1.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2" ><p dir="ltr"><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.0pt;font-weight:bold">\(40\) </span><span\ dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.0pt">The Overall Safety Lifecycle has been modified to take into account that:&#13;a\) In IEC 61508 ed1.0 there was only one specification covering the safety requirements for an E/E/PE safety-related system \(i.e. the E/E/P\ES safety requirements specification\). IEC 61508 ed2.0 now has two specifications: &#13;the E/E/PE system safety requirements specification; see 7.10 and Figure 2 of IEC 61508-1 ed2.0; and&#13;the E/E/PE system design requirements specification; see 7.10\ and Figure 3 of IEC 61508-2 ed2.0.&#13;b\) The change to the overall risk reduction model used in IEC 61508 ed2.0 has led to the merging of Boxes 10 and 11 in Figure 2 of IEC 61508-1 ed1.0 into a single Box 11 in Figure 2 of IEC 61508-1 ed2.0; see also E\xplanation 13.</span></p></body>)/Rect[348.393 500.273 376.957 515.886]/Subtype/Highlight/Type/Annot>>endobj6601 0 obj<</F 28/Open false/Parent 6600 0 R/Rect[595.22 395.427 775.22 515.427]/Subtype/Popup/Type/Annot>>endobj6602 0 obj<</Filter/FlateDecode/Length 5508>>stream
